Query:
--Description: Count how many TCGA-BRCA cases in the hg38 R35 RNA-Seq table contain protein-coding data for BOTH “Primary Tumor” and “Solid Tissue Normal” tissue categories (i.e. each case has at least these two distinct tissue/sample types).
SELECT
    COUNT(*) AS "num_BRCACases_PrimaryTumor_AND_STN"
FROM (
    SELECT
        "case_barcode"
    FROM "TCGA"."TCGA_VERSIONED"."RNASEQ_HG38_GDC_R35"
    WHERE "project_short_name" = 'TCGA-BRCA'
      AND "gene_type"          = 'protein_coding'
    GROUP BY "case_barcode"
    HAVING MAX(CASE WHEN "sample_type_name" = 'Primary Tumor'        THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = 1
       AND MAX(CASE WHEN "sample_type_name" = 'Solid Tissue Normal'  THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) = 1
) s
Answer:
num_BRCACases_PrimaryTumor_AND_STN
1
